# Allowlist: exclude everything, then re-include only what `go build` needs.
# Fail-closed — a new file at the repo root (a key, a .env variant, a report)
# stays out of the build context unless it is added here on purpose.
# Rules are evaluated in order and the last match wins.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!pkg/

# Tests are never compiled into a service binary; keeping them out means a
# test-only change does not invalidate the `COPY . .` layer and rebuild images.
**/*_test.go
